        "textAlign": "center",
        "fontFamily": "Playfair Display, serif",
        "fontWeight": 400,
        "textDecoration": "none"
      },
      "value": "In Witness Whereof, the said Corporation has caused this Certificate to be signed by its duly authorized officers and its Corporate Seal to be hereunto affixed this",
      "autoScale": false
    },
